  "source_texts": {
    "memory": {
      "source_id": "e6ab178b-c0f9-4adb-bfb7-e4648617a950",
      "text": "Looking for a new job with better work-life balance",
      "speaker": "memory",
      "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/before.json"
    },
    "messages": [
      {
        "source_id": "new-0",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I've finally transitioned to a new role, and it's been a huge relief. The balance between work and personal life is much healthier now.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:04:00",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/0/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-1",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "That's fantastic to hear, Martin! Transitioning to a role that offers a healthier balance between professional demands and personal well-being can make a significant difference. Your new role seems to have improved your mental health and job satisfaction. It's also great to see how it supports your humanitarian care goals while maintaining a healthy lifestyle, much like how your artistic goals are equally important to you.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:04:00",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/1/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-2",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Yes, the new role has definitely improved my mental health. The stress and pressure from my previous job were really taking a toll.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:09:03",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/2/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-3",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "It's understandable how the stress and pressure from your previous role could have affected your mental health. Finding a job that aligns with your humanitarian care goals while also allowing you to maintain a healthy lifestyle is key. It's wonderful that your social network played a role in facilitating this career transition, providing support and insights along the way.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:09:03",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/3/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-4",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Absolutely, my friends and colleagues were instrumental in this transition. Their support was invaluable.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:11:33",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/4/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-5",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Having a strong support system is truly invaluable, Martin. Your friends and colleagues provided crucial support and insights that were instrumental in securing new opportunities. It's amazing how they helped you navigate this transition, allowing you to pursue your life goals with renewed vigor and creativity. This new role even allows you to leverage your creativity to inspire and innovate in the healthcare sector.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:11:33",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/5/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-6",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm really optimistic about the future. The new role is empowering me to pursue my goals with more energy.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:14:19",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/6/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-7",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Optimism is such a powerful motivator, Martin. Feeling empowered to pursue your humanitarian care goals through your new role is a testament to your resilience and determination. It's also interesting how your artistic goals play a role in maintaining a healthy lifestyle, providing a creative outlet that complements your work in the healthcare sector.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:14:19",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/7/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-8",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "The support I received was incredible. Susan, Daniel, and Joshua really helped me see things differently.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:16:19",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/8/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-9",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Susan's support and encouragement were crucial in keeping you focused on your goals. Daniel's insights pushed you to think outside the box, and Joshua's collaborative approach positively influenced your leadership style. Together, they helped you secure new opportunities and navigate this transition smoothly. It's remarkable how such a strong network can facilitate personal and professional growth.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:16:19",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/9/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-10",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Yes, their insights were really valuable. It's great to have people who challenge and support you.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:17:57",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/10/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-11",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Having people who both challenge and support you can lead to tremendous growth, Martin. Their insights and encouragement have undoubtedly played a significant role in your successful transition. It's also wonderful to see how your new role allows you to channel your creativity and humanitarian care goals, providing a fulfilling and balanced work environment.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:17:57",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/11/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-12",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm grateful for the balance I've found. It's been a long journey, but worth it.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:22:59",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/12/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-13",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Gratitude is a powerful sentiment, and finding balance is indeed a journey worth taking. Your long journey to achieve this balance, supported by your social network, has led to a role that aligns with your goals and values. It's inspiring to see how your artistic goals also play a role in maintaining this balance, offering a creative outlet that complements your work in the healthcare sector.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:22:59",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/13/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-14",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "The creative aspect of my new role is particularly exciting. It opens up so many possibilities.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:39:30",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/14/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-15",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "The creative aspect of your new role is indeed exciting, Martin. It allows you to explore new possibilities and innovate within the healthcare sector. This aligns beautifully with your humanitarian care goals, offering a platform to inspire and make a meaningful impact. It's also interesting how your artistic goals provide a creative outlet that enhances your personal well-being and professional growth.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:39:30",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/15/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-16",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm looking forward to making a real impact. The new role feels like the perfect fit.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:51:37",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/16/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-17",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Making a real impact is a fulfilling aspiration, and it's wonderful to hear that your new role feels like the perfect fit. This opportunity not only supports your humanitarian care goals but also allows you to leverage your creativity and artistic goals to inspire change. Your optimism and determination are commendable, and they will undoubtedly drive you to achieve great things.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 07:51:37",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/17/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-18",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "It's been a transformative experience. I've learned so much along the way.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:01:28",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/18/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-19",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Transformative experiences often come with valuable lessons, Martin. Your journey has taught you resilience, adaptability, and the importance of aligning your professional path with your personal values. The insights you've gained will continue to guide you as you pursue your goals with renewed vigor and creativity, both in your humanitarian care and artistic endeavors.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:01:28",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/19/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-20",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "The journey has definitely been worth it. I'm excited for what's to come.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:06:55",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/20/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-21",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Your excitement for the future is palpable, Martin. Embracing the journey and recognizing its worth is a testament to your growth and resilience. As you continue to pursue your humanitarian care goals and explore your artistic interests, your new role will provide the platform and support you need to make a meaningful impact.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:06:55",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/21/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-22",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm ready to take on new challenges and opportunities.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:08:10",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/22/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-23",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Taking on new challenges and opportunities is an exciting prospect, Martin. Your readiness to embrace them, supported by your strong network and newfound balance, will undoubtedly lead to personal and professional growth. As you continue to leverage your creativity and humanitarian care goals, you'll inspire and innovate in ways that make a lasting impact.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:08:10",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/23/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-24",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "The future feels bright, and I'm eager to make a difference.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:10:11",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/24/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-25",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "A bright future awaits you, Martin, filled with opportunities to make a difference. Your eagerness to contribute to the healthcare sector, combined with your artistic goals, will drive you to create positive change. Your journey has equipped you with the tools and insights needed to pursue your goals with passion and purpose.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:10:11",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/25/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-26",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm grateful for the support I've received. It's made all the difference.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:12:57",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/26/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-27",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Gratitude for the support you've received is a beautiful sentiment, Martin. Your friends and colleagues have played a pivotal role in your journey, providing guidance and encouragement that have made all the difference. As you continue to pursue your goals, their support will remain a valuable asset, helping you navigate new challenges and opportunities.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:12:57",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/27/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-28",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "Their support has been a cornerstone of my success.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:17:50",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/28/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-29",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Support from your network has indeed been a cornerstone of your success, Martin. Their insights and encouragement have empowered you to transition to a role that aligns with your values and goals. As you continue to pursue your humanitarian care and artistic endeavors, their support will be instrumental in helping you achieve your aspirations.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:17:50",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/29/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-30",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm excited to see where this new path will lead me.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:21:28",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/30/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-31",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Your excitement for the journey ahead is inspiring, Martin. This new path, supported by your humanitarian care and artistic goals, will lead you to new opportunities for growth and impact. Embrace the possibilities and continue to leverage your creativity and insights to inspire change in the healthcare sector.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:21:28",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/31/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-32",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "The potential for impact is what drives me.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:24:39",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/32/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-33",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "The potential for impact is a powerful driver, Martin. Your commitment to making a difference in the healthcare sector, combined with your artistic goals, will lead you to create meaningful change. Your new role provides the platform to leverage your creativity and humanitarian care goals, inspiring others and making a lasting impact.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:24:39",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/33/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-34",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm grateful for the journey and the lessons I've learned.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:28:49",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/34/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-35",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
        "text": "Gratitude for the journey and its lessons is a testament to your growth, Martin. The experiences and insights you've gained will guide you as you continue to pursue your humanitarian care and artistic goals. Embrace the opportunities ahead and continue to make a positive impact in the healthcare sector.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:28:49",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/35/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-36",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "user",
        "text": "I'm ready to embrace the future with open arms.",
        "recorded_at": "Mar 01, 2026, 08:32:54",
        "source_ref": "results/medium_dev/williams_native_prefix5_20261028_v3/users/2f1f897e-d67f-dbc5-6a7b-b7634a9e294f/session_008/input.json#/raw_dialogue/36/content"
      },
      {
        "source_id": "new-37",
        "side": "new",
        "speaker": "assistant",
